{"seq":3,"slug":"integration-e2e","title":"集成与端到端测试","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/integration-e2e","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"infrastructure-integration-tests","title":"基础设施集成测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/integration-e2e/infrastructure-integration-tests","wordCount":1070,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"network-connectivity-testing","title":"网络连通性测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/integration-e2e/network-connectivity-testing","wordCount":996,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"security-compliance-scanning","title":"安全合规扫描","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/integration-e2e/security-compliance-scanning","wordCount":1186,"readingTime":5}],"introMarkdown":"# 集成与端到端测试\n\n本章处理基础设施测试金字塔的上层：跨资源的集成验证、网络连通性的端到端确认、以及安全合规的自动化扫描。\n\n这些测试的共同特征是需要真实或仿真的云环境、执行时间较长、成本较高，但它们能捕获单元测试无法发现的组合问题——例如安全组规则与路由表的交互效果、跨 VPC 的 DNS 解析链路、或资源配置是否满足 CIS 基准。\n"}